{"ref":"BDB, חֶבְרוֹן²","hw":"חֶבְרוֹן²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְרוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> (𝔊 Χεβρων).<br><strong>1.</strong>  grandson of Levi <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:18\" href=\"/Exodus.6.18\">Ex 6:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:19\" href=\"/Numbers.3.19\">Nu 3:19</a> (both P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.28\">1 Ch 5:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.3\">6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.12\">23:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.19\">19</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.9\">15:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  name in Caleb’s family <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.42\">1 Ch 2:42</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.43\">43</a>.","next":"BDB, חֶבְרוֹנִי","prev":"BDB, חֶבְרוֹן"}